<DownloadLayout platform="steamDeck" title="Steam Deck" description="Install Refract in desktop mode, then add it to Steam for quick access in Gaming Mode.">
  <h2>Steam Deck setup</h2><ol><li>Switch to Desktop Mode and download the AppImage.</li><li>Open Properties and allow the file to run as a program.</li><li>Launch Refract once and sign in.</li><li>In Steam, choose <strong>Add a Non-Steam Game</strong> and browse to the AppImage.</li><li>Return to Gaming Mode and configure your preferred controller layout.</li></ol><p>Refract manages the launcher experience; controller behavior inside Minecraft depends on the game version, modpack, or controller mod you install.</p>
</DownloadLayout>
